@startuml sequence-build
!theme plain
title Litho Build Sequence Diagram

actor Author
participant "CLI/Editor" as CLI
participant "Interpreter" as Int
participant "Template Loader" as TL
participant "LaTeX Codegen" as LG
participant "Tectonic" as Tex
participant "Metadata Embedder" as ME

Author -> CLI: litho build doc.md --template thesis
CLI -> Int: compile(doc.md, templateId)
Int -> TL: load schema/manifest/assets
TL --> Int: template bundle
Int -> Int: parse -> AST -> bind
Int -> LG: generate(tex)
LG --> Int: tex content
Int -> Tex: compile(tex)
Tex --> Int: pdf bytes
Int -> ME: embed(source, templateId, version)
ME --> Int: pdf with metadata
Int --> CLI: result(pdf path)
CLI --> Author: success
@enduml
